        {
          "q": "Evaluate $\\int_0^4 f(x)\\,dx$ where $f(x)=x$ for $x\\leq2$ and $f(x)=2x-2$ for $x>2$.",
          "answer": "$\\int_0^2 x\\,dx + \\int_2^4(2x-2)\\,dx = \\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^2 + \\left[x^2-2x\\right]_2^4 = 2 + (8-0) = 10$."
